{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-gen-5-1","title":"Genesis 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Recapitulation of the creation of man. 3 The genealogy, age, and death of the patriarchs from Adam to Noah. 22 The godliness and translation of Enoch. 25 The birth of Noah, etc.</p>\n<p>book.The original word rendered \"book,\" signifies a register, account, history, or any kind of writing.</p>\n<p>2:4; 6:9; 10:1; 1Ch 1:1; Mt 1:1; Lu 3:36-38 in the likeness. 1:26,27; Ec 7:29; 12:1; 1Co 11:7; 2Co 3:18; Eph 4:24; Col 3:10 Heb 1:3; 12:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-2","title":"Genesis 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Male. 1:27; Mal 2:15 their. 2:15,23; *marg: Ac 17:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-3","title":"Genesis 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>A.M. 130. B.C. 3874. hundred.The chronology differs in the Hebrew Text, the Samaritan, the LXX., and Josephus. The LXX. adds 100 years to each of the patriarchs Adam, Seth, Enos, Cainan, Mahalaleel, and Enoch, before the birth of their sons; while they take 20 from the age of Methuselah, and add 6 to that of Lamech. Thus the space from the creation to the deluge is made 2,242 years, according to the Vatican copy, but 2,262 by the Alexandrine; and the sum total by Josephus is 2,265, by the Samaritan 1,307, and the Hebrew Text, 1,656. The sum total from the Deluge to the 70th year of Terah, according to these authorities, is, Heb. 292; Sam. 942; Sept. Vat. 1,172; Alex. 1,072, and Josephus 1,002.</p>\n<p>in his. Job 14:4; 15:14-16; 25:4; Ps 14:2,3; 51:5; Lu 1:35; Joh 3:6; Ro 5:12 1Co 15:39; Eph 2:3 called. 4:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-4","title":"Genesis 5:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>And the. 1Ch 1:1-3; Lu 3:36-38 and he. 7,10,13,19,22,26,30; 1:28; 9:1,7; 11:12; Ps 127:3; 144:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-5","title":"Genesis 5:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>A.M. 930. B.C. 3074. nine. 8,11,14,17-32; De 30:20; Ps 90:10 and he died. 8,11,14-32; 3:19; 2Sa 14:14; Job 30:23; Ps 49:7-10; 89:48; Ec 9:5,8 Ec 12:5,7; Eze 18:4; Ro 5:12-14; 1Co 15:21,22; Heb 9:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-6","title":"Genesis 5:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>A.M. 235. B.C. 3769. begat. 4:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-8","title":"Genesis 5:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>A.M. 1042. B.C. 2962. 8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-9","title":"Genesis 5:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>A.M. 325. B.C. 3679. Cainan. Heb. Kenan. 1Ch 1:2; Lu 3:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-10","title":"Genesis 5:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>begat. 4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-11","title":"Genesis 5:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>A.M. 1140. B.C. 2864. died. 5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-12","title":"Genesis 5:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>A.M. 395. B.C. 3609. Mahalaleel. Gr. Maleleel. Lu 3:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-13","title":"Genesis 5:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>and begat. 4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-14","title":"Genesis 5:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>A.M. 1235. B.C. 2769. 5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-15","title":"Genesis 5:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>A.M. 460. B.C. 3544. Jared. Heb. Jered. 1Ch 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-16","title":"Genesis 5:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>and begat. 4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-17","title":"Genesis 5:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>A.M. 1290. B.C. 2714. died. 5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-18","title":"Genesis 5:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>A.M. 622. B.C. 3382. Enoch. 4:17; 1Ch 1:3 Henoch. Lu 3:37; Jude 1:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-19","title":"Genesis 5:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>and begat. 4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-20","title":"Genesis 5:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>he died. 5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-21","title":"Genesis 5:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>A.M. 687. B.C. 3317. Methuselah. Gr. Mathusala. Lu 3:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-22","title":"Genesis 5:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>6:9; 17:1; 24:40; 48:15