p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-30","title":"Genesis 5:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>begat sons. 4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-31","title":"Genesis 5:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>A.M. 1651. B.C. 2353. he died. 5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-5-32","title":"Genesis 5:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>A.M. 1556. B.C. 2448. Shem. 6:10; 7:13; 9:18,19,22-27; 10:1,21,32; 1Ch 1:4-28; Lu 3:36</p>"}]}